    1. Generate synthetic training data (3000 passwords)
   ├─ 1000 weak   (common patterns)
   ├─ 1000 medium (mixed complexity)
   └─ 1000 strong (high entropy)

2. Extract features from each password
   └─ length, lowercase, uppercase, digits, special, entropy

3. Train RandomForestClassifier
   └─ Save model as password_model.pkl

4. Load model in Flask app
   └─ Predict strength for every user password

5. Combine ML prediction + rule-based analysis
   └─ Hybrid system (more accurate than either alone)